      "source": [
        "# Experimentally Testes Claude's Long-Context QA Abilities"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "[DISCLAIMER: este notebook was created using Claude 2 models e is considered legacy.]\n\nIn este notebook, we will take a look at Claude's ability para answer questions sobre the meeting notes de a long government document. We will also see como este ability varies depending on the location of the relevant information. The government document is dividir up into muitos smaller subsections. Each question will be sobre information contained in one of aqueles subsections. todos the questions e answers will be written by Claude!\n\nSummary of o que is para come:\n\n1. Downloading e preprocessing the data\n2. Using Claude para escrever 400 multiple-choice questions sobre specific sections of the data\n3. Validating aquele Claude is able para answer aqueles questions quando given aquele section alone\n4. Validating aquele Claude is unable para answer aqueles questions quando given a random other chunk\n5. Testes Claude's ability para answer the questions even quando the context tamanho gets muito long."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "### Data Prep"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "para iniciar: baixar the document e dividir isso up into chunks. Each chunk corresponds para a meeting Nota de one department, such as the Department of Transportation."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": nulo,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
