      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "agora, isso's tempo para use Claude para generate questions e answers! We'll use a two-shot prompt modelo aquele includes two example (chunks, questions, answers) groups along com instructions. We'll ask para five questions sobre each chunk, com 3 wrong answers e 1 direita answer."
