        "print_results(qa_df, qa_df['qa_answer_right_chunk'])"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "isso got 90% of them direita. agora, we'll see como Claude does quando, instead of giving Claude the chunk com the answer, we give isso alguns random other chunk. Poor Claude!"
