    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "By sheer chance Claude would be expected para obter 25% direita. In practice, Claude got 36% direita. Just as smart humans like us have the ability para guess acima chance on a standardized teste, so does Claude. Still a far cry de Claude's accuracy quando given the direita chunk, so the experiment is meaningful. We'll filtrar out the questions onde Claude didn't obter the correct answer even com the relevant chunk, as aqueles are \"demais difficult\" para Testes the impact of long context."
      ]
